2. sza i-na li-<bi> szi-mu-ru-um{ki} 
#tr.ts: ša ina li(b)bi šimu(r)rum
#tr.en: that in Šimurrum
3. _ki_ ARAD-{d}en-lil2 u3 s,il2-li2-isz8-tar2 
#tr.ts: itti warad-enlil u ṣilli-ištar
