#tr.en: at the Old Gate of Šamaš
16. {disz}dingir-szu-a-bu-szu _dumu_ {d}suen-na-s,ir 
#tr.ts: ilšu-abūšu mār sîn-nāṣir
#tr.en: Ilšu-abūšu son of Sîn-nāṣir,
17. {disz}ARAD-{d}en-lil2 u3 s,il2-li2-isz8-tar2 
#tr.ts: warad-enlil u ṣilli-ištar
#tr.en: Warad-enlil and Ṣilli-ištar
18. im-ta-ag-ru-ma 
#tr.ts: imtagrūma
#tr.en: have reached an agreement and
19. a-na _6(disz) gin2 ku3-babbar_ sza za-ba-an{ki} 
#tr.ts: ana šeššet šiqil kaspim ša zaban
#tr.en: for the 6 shekels of silver from (lit. of) Zaban
20. u3 _1(u) gin2 ku3-babbar_ 
#tr.ts: u ešret šiqil kaspim
#tr.en: and the 10 shekels of silver
@reverse 
1. sza zimbir{ki}-ra-bi-im 
#tr.ts: ša sippar-rabîm
#tr.en: from (lit. of) Sippar-rabîm,
2. asz-szum _ansze_-szu-nu il-qu2-u2 
#tr.ts: aššum imērīšunu ilqû
#tr.en: that for their donkey they had taken,
