#tr.en: Ilšu-abūšu son of Sîn-nāṣir,
8. {disz}ARAD-{d}en-lil2 s,il2-li2-isz8-tar2 
#tr.ts: warad-enlil ṣilli-ištar
#tr.en: Warad-enlil (and) Ṣilli-ištar,
9. a-hu-um a-na a-hi-im asz-szum _ansze_ 
#tr.ts: aḫum ana aḫim aššum imērim
#tr.en: one against the other, concerning the donkey,
10. u2-ul e-ra-ga-am 
#tr.ts: ul era(g)gam
#tr.en: will not raise a claim,
11. _mu_ {d}utu {d}marduk a-pil-{d}suen 
#tr.ts: nīš šamaš marduk apil-sîn
#tr.en: by the life of Šamaš, Marduk, Apil-sîn
12. u3 _iri_ zimbir{ki} isz-ti-ni-isz it-mu 
